notedown is not affiliated with Ratta or Supernote.

The Supernote .note format was documented from sample files and public
community research, see docs/note-format.md. The .note parser in
crates/notedown-note is a clean-room implementation of that document.
The source code in this repository includes no third-party code.

The binary releases (the notedown archives and packages, the Notedown app
and the container image) are built with third-party code: Rust crates, and
in the macOS builds llama.cpp and the code it bundles. Their licenses are
listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt, which ships with each release.
